WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
 (whispering "Maggie-lo")

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:10.000
 (singing)

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.000
 You step up, swing it on the first green

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.000
 Drive straight down like a laser beam

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.000
 Confidence drive they've never seen

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.000
 But I know how this will go

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.000
 Ball's in the bunker on whole tree

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.000
 Still you smile like it's old routine

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.000
 You line it up, you play it clean

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.000
 Never cheat or let it roll

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.000
 Straight shooter who can't shoot straight

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.000
 You never won, never hesitate

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.000
 Chocolate strokes put you on your fate

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.000
 You tee it up, but you won't escape

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:40.000
 I watch the score climb with the sun

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.000
 We're way past par, but having fun

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.000
 Hit the water, you never run

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:46.000
 It's a magic valley where

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:49.000
 Fork put, freeze and rump that bite

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:51.000
 Still you laugh through every slice

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.000
 No like is no secret, right?

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:55.000
 Sponge to a fold, I swear

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:57.000
 Straight shooter who can't shoot straight

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.000
 You never won, never hesitate

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:01.000
 You tee it up, but you won't escape

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:03.000
 Could've kicked it out, but that's not you

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:06.000
 Counting every swing, no matter true or screwed

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:08.000
 You score card, looks like modern art

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.000
 But you play around with an honest heart

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:12.000
 Straight shooter who can't shoot straight

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:15.000
 You never won, never hesitate

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:17.000
