00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:19.000
 You tee it up, but you won't escape

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:30.000
 Still you smile through every hole

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.000
 A legend with a bougie soul

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:35.000
 Can't shoot straight, but it makes you whole

